# Generated artefacts. Prettier must not touch them: the gate byte-diffs each one against
# what its generator emits, so a formatter rewriting them would make the check fail with a
# diff nobody authored -- and "the formatter did it" is indistinguishable from "the source
# changed" in a byte diff.
